        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Contemporary Commercial 9\" Offset Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary design offset door pull has 9\" Center to Center mounting points with a total length of 10-1/8\". Most often used on metal framed glass commercial doors such as restaurant entry doors, storefront doors, office entry doors, etc. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Longer <a href=\"/products/10-inch-contemporary-commercial-offset-door-pull-global-th1100-sted-pull\"><b>10\" Offset Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GLO-TH1100-STED-PULL-9-size.gif?v=1704354581\" width=\"300\" height=\"350\" border=\"0\" alt=\"9 Inch Commercial Offset Door Pull Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Global TH1100-STED-PULL-9 Offset Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 9\"  C/C (distance between the 2 mounting bolts)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Non-Rusting Aluminum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These offset door pulls are packaged standard for Surface Mounting (1/4-20 machine threaded stud) and include installation hardware. The two studs are tapped (1/4-20 thread) into the aluminum door frame. Then the pull handle is slipped over the studs and secured with Allen set screws to provide a clean concealed fastener look.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Available in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish to match the common glass door frame colors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
