                "title": "9 Inch Offset Door Pull, Global TH1100-STED-PULL-9",
                "description": "Global TH1100-STED-PULL-9 - This contemporary design offset door pull has 9 inch Center to Center mounting points with a total length of 10-1/8 inches. Most often used on metal framed glass commercial doors such as restaurant entry doors, storefront doors, office entry doors, etc.",
